I have been tasked with creating a Data base for the optional version of Cash me Up
Tools that I have used is  Supabase as a ebviroment for the architecture of thwe Data base
I will create 3 tables on the enviroment, Loans, Referrals and Customer profiles
The whole schema will be created and secured with the Supabase data protection RLS(Row Level Security) hwich is identical to POPIA
Once the schema is complete , will use Type script edge functions to check the logic of the Data base schema and trigger the automated referral emails using Resend. 
